  "content": "\n\n<p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/847812/description_7bd32978-05b6-49bd-872f-0e1a84c711b1.png\" width=\"589\" height=\"608\"></p>\n<p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/847812/description_fc3da0a2-b109-4fa7-949d-cc997ee2d59f.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"800\" height=\"136\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/847812/description_3749e5ff-7789-4f48-853e-92f6dd6c31f0.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"850\" height=\"583\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/847812/description_02b868da-812e-46e8-ac59-d2f9b62c069d.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"850\" height=\"583\"></strong></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/847812/description_8f8b6126-36f7-4057-ba9f-f5affb7ac92a.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"850\" height=\"583\"></strong></p>\n<h1 style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>Midnight Madness</strong> требует <strong>GeckoLib</strong></h1>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/geckolib\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/847812/description_db7b4508-205c-4c5c-8646-bea435b2b0f8.png\" alt=\"GeckoLib\" width=\"341\" height=\"247\"></strong></a></p>\n<h1 style=\"text-align:center\">Создано с помощью <span style=\"color:#71cb50\"><a style=\"color:#71cb50\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmcreator.net%252fmodification%252f96084%252fmidnight-madness\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>MCreator</strong></a></span></h1>\n<hr>\n<h1 style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>Последняя версия Midnight Madness совместима с:<br></strong>- <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/nonexistentplus\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Nonexistent+</a><br>- <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/born-in-chaos\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Born in Chaos</a><br>- <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/alexs-mobs\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Alex's Mobs</a><br>- <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/the-twilight-forest\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">The Twilight Forest</a></h1>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><em>Мобы из этих модов будут выбрасывать души, если совместимость включена в конфигурационном файле (Midnight-Madness-Compatibility).</em></p>\n<h1 style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>Поддерживаемые языки: </strong>Английский,&nbsp;Русский</h1>\n<h1 style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>Обзоры мода<br></strong><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=IuR3W_q473k\" rel=\"nofollow\">Русский (Устаревший)</a></h1>\n<hr>\n<h1 style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>Другие мои проекты</strong></h1>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/nonexistentplus\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/847812/description_59283cfb-6b7f-4282-ba19-97243fd30b6f.png\" alt=\"Nonexistent+\" width=\"256\" height=\"256\"></a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/theotherside\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/847812/description_aabfd591-4cef-440b-82af-244f11943097.jpg\" alt=\"The Otherside\" width=\"256\" height=\"256\"></a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/dotamod\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/847812/description_a468c93a-8eca-49c5-afd1-c2d9e6068590.png\" alt=\"Dota Mod\" width=\"256\" height=\"256\"></a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/timeless-power\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/847812/description_9b3b4ba3-89ea-4aae-aa58-98da308090b9.png\" alt=\"Timeless Power\" width=\"256\" height=\"256\"></a></p>\n<hr>\n<h1 style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><a href=\"https://discord.gg/q5wqa93xX2\" rel=\"nofollow\">Присоединяйтесь к моему Discord-серверу!</a></strong></h1>",
